WEBVTT

00:23:59.350 --> 00:24:00.643
ND: Wow.

00:24:00.643 --> 00:24:03.021
HH: And I said, "I don't even
know what that is."

00:24:03.021 --> 00:24:06.983
So she encouraged me and I applied.

00:24:06.983 --> 00:24:09.611
When it came time
for letters of recommendation,

00:24:09.611 --> 00:24:13.865
I asked my chemistry teacher
to write me a letter, and he said no.

00:24:14.657 --> 00:24:16.034
And I said, "Why not?"

00:24:16.034 --> 00:24:18.286
He said, "You'll never get into MIT."

00:24:19.579 --> 00:24:23.166
So I asked my history teacher instead,

00:24:23.208 --> 00:24:26.628
and she did write a letter
and I did get into MIT.

00:24:26.669 --> 00:24:28.796
And when I brought back
my acceptance letter

00:24:28.838 --> 00:24:32.133
and showed it to my chemistry teacher --
“Look, I got into MIT.” --